States, Europe and in other jurisdictions, including to fund the preparation and filing of regulatory submissions for AKB-9778 with the
FDA, the EMA and other regulatory authorities;
• the scope, progress, results and costs of preclinical development, laboratory testing and clinical trials that we may undertake for ARP-1536
